se off you become the next time  around that you have to deal with anger  and this works this way not just in sort  of the abstract  but it works that way with particulars  as well if you're angry with with a  particular person  and you don't deal with it well and you  don't reconcile you don't eventually let  it go  the next time around that they do  something to you you've got those old  scars already in place  and they're ready to open up and become  you know bleeding  wounds that when that person eventually  offends you  so it becomes very important to try to  take  bad habits and reduce them  and then replace them with good habits  habits that are opposed to them in the  case of anger  this would be things like learning how  to  uh be empathetic and see the other  person's position learning how to let go  learning how to forgive and also  learning how to maintain a proper  perspective  about how important it is for you to  feel that way or to say the things that  you say
 

